#: skills/workflows/content-change-review.bpmn:27
#. Diagram element documentation
msgid "Owns the entire technical execution of the change end to end — scoping impact, branching, editing both narrative content and deterministic logic, assessing what else it touches, weighing how to absorb that, and pushing. It is also the single re-entry point for both the author's and the committee's feedback, which is why Task_Iterate has two incoming edges rather than the diagram forking a second revision path."
msgstr ""

