#: skills/workflows/content-change-review.bpmn:448
#. Diagram element documentation
msgid "Second dispatch point: the change was approved and merged, and the root of the site has been rebuilt from main. This is the moment docs-site.yml failed all 30 times over two months (bean xom7) while looking exactly like a green run from inside the repo. `note` rather than `claim`, and the difference is not cosmetic. By here the branch-watch bean already exists, and whether the publish SUCCEEDED is a judgement this step cannot make -- the build reports its own exit code, and xom7 is the record of that being believed. AGENTS.md: a bean is not closed on someone else's say-so. So the step records what it observed and leaves the verdict to the watcher."
msgstr ""

